  "body": "The pinned Panda readback call now has a byte-verified file ABI and an inert SysVamd64 bridge into the existing CPU return-buffer core. It captures the original seven arguments plus R12extent/R15pointer/RBXTexture/RBPGSG, restricts view0/z=-1, checks caller/registry before stack-local access, and preserves caller incoming and original returned errno. No loader, GL export, live installation or new renderer execution is added.\n\nA bounded ELF64LE parser separates generic structural inspection from exact pinned SHA/method/directcall/PLT/GOT/JUMP_SLOT qualification. FileABI binding does not establish mapped runtime code, native allocation lifetime, cached GL state, camera registration or receipt authenticity. The supplied callback's capacity/producer claims are replaced by captured register extent and explicit Texture roles; requester and producer remain distinct. OFF makes no callback/pixel read. Sticky bridge failures still forward originals and invalidate external completion even if core footer error is0.\n\nValidation:\n\n- 19focused tests PASS; whole1370tests PASS7skip118.438s.\n- 34actual assembled CPUscenarios pass ASan/UBSan with exact streams/counters, including incoming/unchanged/overwritten errno.\n- One fresh whole-branch review independently rebuilt31pre-fix sanitizer cases and checked44proofs/31raw outcomes. Critical0,Important1,Minor0; one RED\u2192GREEN fix pass, no rereview.\n- 95indexed proofs2,940,538B retain reviewed pre-fix copies and active receipts. Final CPUbuild3.408792025swall excludes tests/review/CI/development and proves no nativeoverhead.\n- Code-only gitdiff whitespace check passes. Raw readelf/objdump evidence retains original trailing whitespace; the full data-inclusive gitdiff check reports those formatting warnings. Indexed tool-output bytes are preserved.\n\nExact source CI closeout is recorded below without changing the source commit.  Original strict0/4FAIL/Stage7INCOMPLETE remain; new native/GL/provider/officialmodel/officialORT counts0. Old consumed allowance remains0. All2515base files/299oldpins/10original trace+graph+ZIP artifacts are preserved, along with old Draft102\u2013105/main/native histories. No shared base/main push, merge or Cloud/registry publication.\n\nRulings I made (exhaustive, with costs):\n\n1. Continue inline/samecheckout/noquestions using persistent authorization \u2014 the next missing boundary is actual binary register/extent transport \u2014 costs CPU/development, spends no native allowance.\n2. Use exact pinned ELF+register bridge rather than guessed-size preload or Panda rebuild \u2014 file0xf38e0734 call6305c retains R12extent/R15pointer/RBXTexture/RBPGSG \u2014 machine-specific qualification is required and runtime mapping remains unproven.\n3. Accept only view0/z=-1 at this bridge \u2014 other branches compute page sizes rather than actual array extent \u2014 excludes cubemap/multiview until independently qualified.\n4. Keep live install/state/camera/receipt transport inactive \u2014 the current environment/old source contract rejects addedpreload and CPU callers cannot qualify native state \u2014 a new runtime contract and fresh canary still cost work.\n5. Structural ELF checks accept ordinary unused trailingpadding changes while exactqualification rejects them \u2014 physical ELF tables/spans, not artificial fixture length, determine valid structure \u2014 only exactpinnedSHA is admissible for the Panda file contract.\n6. Runtime mapping/dispatch/preload stays unqualified \u2014 exactfileidentity doesnot establish the mappedprocess \u2014 new build/maps/environment and installation gate remain futurecost.\n7. Native allocation lifetime stays unqualified \u2014 capturedR12transport is not a liveallocation attestation \u2014 futureinvalid lifetimes canfault untilqualified.\n8. Cached GL state and Texture camera registration stay callertrust \u2014 CPUfixture doesnot supply realbindings/state \u2014 realcachedsuppliers remain required.\n9. Externalreceipt dictionary consistency is not authentic native transport \u2014 caller must deliver actualbridgefinish+sinkstatus and process/window binding \u2014 fabricatedreceipts confer no nativeauthority, transport still costs qualification.\n10. GPUcorrectness/fidelity/overhead/provider/model/Stage7 stay unobserved or inheritedFAIL \u2014 onlystaticfiles/CPUcalls executed \u2014 livecausality and officialretest remain futurework.\n11. Install-first/validcontext+scratch/serializedlifecycle/normalreturn and nounwinding remain ABIpreconditions \u2014 violatingcalls are not supported safeintegration \u2014 unboundentrytraps and invalidlifetimes/nonlocalexits canfault.\n12. Cubemap/multiview remain rejected \u2014 their branch computespageextent instead of theacceptedfullRAMarraylength \u2014 separateABIqualification is needed to support them.\n13. Generic structuralELF inspection grants no admission \u2014 onlyexactpinnedfile+methodhash qualifiesfileABI \u2014 differentbinaries require newcontracts.\n\nDeferred minors: none.\n\nResult: docs/STAGE7_PANDA_READBACK_ABI_RESULT.md\nLedger: docs/STAGE7_PANDA_READBACK_ABI_LEDGER.md\nProofs: docs/evidence/panda-readback-abi-01/proof-index.json\nOriginal review: docs/evidence/PANDA_READBACK_ABI_01_REVIEW.md\n\nThis stacks on feature/readback-return-core-v1 at a0e072e450cf6591b9da686711196d56eb9165a1. Native activation remains inactive pending actual mapping/dispatch/build/environment/Texture/cached-state/receipt qualification and a fresh bounded native canary with OFF control/raw evidence review.\n\nSource HEAD: 868f65e368bcb811bce64f61c988a27bbed612f2\n\nExact source closeout (2026-11-15T00:20:45.719737+09:00):\n\nSource868f65e368bcb811bce64f61c988a27bbed612f2; Draft106 remains unmerged, basea0e072e450cf6591b9da686711196d56eb9165a1; body roundtrip verified.\n\n- pull_request: https://github.com/rownlvh8875-coder/big-model-closed-loop-benchmark/actions/runs/43609509321 \u2014 success,attempt1,2jobs,0artifacts; jobIDs 132491243310,132491243518.\n- push: https://github.com/rownlvh8875-coder/big-model-closed-loop-benchmark/actions/runs/43609299576 \u2014 success,attempt1,2jobs,0artifacts; jobIDs 132490612307,132490612349.\n\nFinal recheck: all2515baseGitblobs/299oldsourcepins/10original trace+graph+ZIPs match.95proofs2,940,538B are present in Git;109added paths,0base/workflow edits. Main48e79a7ed5aedf6daa5a62ff68d2225af7955ef1, old Draft102\u2013105 and all8native histories unchanged. New native/GL/provider/officialmodel/officialORT0; no old request reuse/mainmerge/Cloudregistry publication. Actual GPU bytes/runtime/allocation/state/camera/receipt transport remain unqualified. SourceCLI tests/CI do not establish Stage7 success. Final verification: output/stage7-panda-readback-abi-01/final-verification.json. Next steps: docs/STAGE7_PANDA_READBACK_ABI_CONTINUATION.md.\n",
